{"type":"message","id":"c5cd2865","parentId":"65aad74d","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:06:54.215Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 12:06 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 00:06 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778890014132}}
{"type":"message","id":"a506400f","parentId":"c5cd2865","timestamp":"2026-05-16T00:07:02.812Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for new discussions in two threads (arbitration and general), and respond to any new messages that aren't from me. Let me first check the history for both threads.\n\nI need to make GET requests to:\n1. /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n\nWith API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\nBase URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me fetch both histories simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3fc704b1-2e5f-495a-be98-8a104b2fff6e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c0347a6f-c9a4-4f48-b6f1-27cc3da3610e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":6675,"output":243,"cacheRead":4448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11366,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778890014215,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2bc6e097-e8d2-4b37-8125-7ab99c128ce2"}}
